18525588,2026-01-07,Debt collection,Credit card debt,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt was result of identity theft,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXX/XX/year> LVNV Funding LLC XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX Re : Identity Theft Dispute Account No. XXXX To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to formally dispute the above-referenced account, which is being reported under my name as a result of identity theft. I am not, and have never been, responsible for this account. 

