18794913,2026-01-16,Debt collection,I do not know,Communication tactics,Frequent or repeated calls,"Company : XXXX ( XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX exact legal entity unknown ) Original Creditor : XXXX  Method of Contact : XXXX Message Phone Number Used : ( XXXX ) XXXX ( XXXX ) XXXX Reference/File Number Provided : XXXX XXXX XX/XX/year> I am filing this complaint regarding unlawful, deceptive, and abusive debt collection practices by XXXX, who claims to be collecting a debt allegedly owed to XXXX. XXXX contacted me via unsolicited text message demanding payment and offering a time-limited settlement, while failing to comply with multiple federal consumer protection laws. 

Facts : On the date shown in the attached evidence, XXXX sent me a text message stating that I have a delinquent account with XXXX in the amount of {$4400.00}. The message pressured me to act immediately by claiming a TODAY ONLY 80 % settlement offer, asserted that payment would be reported as Paid in Full to all major credit bureaus, and instructed me to call a phone number to resolve the account. 

