roperly sent before repossession or generated afterward. The attached screenshots establish what was represented at the time of the transaction, which conflicts with later regulator-facing explanations. XXXX. Post-Repossession Notice Timing Email Metadata Remains Unrefuted- The company claims the XX/XX/XXXX email was merely a courtesy copy. However : A. The email metadata shows first transmission on XX/XX/XXXX, XXXX I never received a receipt of any earlier mailed notice, XXXX The timing coincides directly with the filing of complaints. This creates a credibility issue that can not be resolved by unsupported assertions alone. XXXX. Law Enforcement Involvement Clarification Requested- I have referenced XXXX Police Department XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, led by XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, in which four arrests have been made in relation to this case. The companys categorical denial of any relevance further underscores the need for independent review. XXXX. This Filing Contains New Evidence- Contrary to the companys claim, this complaint includes : A. XXXX contemporaneous text-message screenshots, XXXX Time-stamped communications initiated by the dealership, XXXX Evidence of representations inconsistent with the final contract and post-repossession narrative.",,"Auto Now Financial Services, Inc., Phoenix, AZ Branch",AZ,85120,,Web,2026-01-20,Closed with explanation,Yes
