19047569,2026-01-27,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,"Other features, terms, or problems",Other problem,"I am filing a complaint regarding Discover Banks handling of a credit card billing dispute involving XXXX transactions in the amounts of {$410.00} and {$200.00}, originally disputed on approximately XX/XX/year>. 

